cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it, the package sdg-tech-tagger-rs, text2sdg and OpenAlex."
title: "sdg-tech-tagger-rs data: 300,001 OpenAlex works tagged with SDGs and digital technologies by queries and by LLMs"
type: dataset
version: "0.1.0"
license: CC-BY-4.0
abstract: >-
  A random sample of 300,001 OpenAlex works of 2019 to 2024, tagged with
  sustainable development goals by the four query systems of text2sdg
  (Aurora, Elsevier, SIRIS, Auckland), run both in R (text2sdg 1.1.2) and in
  its Rust port sdg-tech-tagger-rs in two modes, with the words each matched;
  with digital technologies by two query sets; and by two large language
  models. Identifiers and tags only, no text.
keywords:
  - sustainable development goals
  - SDG
  - text2sdg
  - digital technologies
  - OpenAlex
  - bibliometrics
  - large language models
authors:
